# ADB-First Device Automation

- Use ADB whenever it supports the requested BlueStacks or KingShot action.
- Perform taps, swipes, key events, screenshots, and screen transitions through ADB.
- Verify every transition from an ADB screenshot or readable map coordinate bar.
- Never continue a map capture after the game leaves the World map.
- Prefer explicit popup `X` controls in either top corner before fallback dismissal.
- Use non-ADB automation only when ADB cannot perform the action; state the reason.
